  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\n**1) × and +**\n\n→ 36 – 5 × **240 ÷ 6** + 17 = 203\n\n→ 36 – **5 × 40** + 17 = 203\n\n→ **36** – 200 **+**** 17** = 203\n\n→ 53 – 200 = 203\n\n→ - 147 ≠ 203\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) ÷ and +**\n\n→ 36 – **5 ÷ 240** + 6 × 17 = 203\n\n→ 36 – 1/48 + **6 × 17** = 203\n\n→ **36** – 1/48 **+ 102** = 203\n\n→ 138 – 1/48 ≠ 203\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**3) ÷ and –**\n\n→ **36 ÷ 5** + 240 – 6 × 17 = 203\n\n→ 36/5 + 240 – **6 × 17** = 203\n\n→ **36/5 ****+ 240** – 102 = 203\n\n→ 247.2 – 102 = 203\n\n→ 145.2 ≠ 203\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n4) **– and ×**\n\n→ 36 × 5 + **240 ÷ 6** – 17 = 203\n\n→ **36 ****× 5** + 40 – 17 = 203\n\n→ **180 + 40** – 17 = 203\n\n→ 220 – 17 = 203\n\n→ 203 = 203\n\n→ **LHS = RHS** ⇒ **Satisfies the equation.**\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 4 satisfies the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****– and ×\"**.",
